        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami waamba kuti, Bantu aba balandiswenenya mulomo wabo, balandilemya amilomo yabo, pele myoyo yabo baitantamuna kule, akuyoowa kwabo nkubandiyoowa ngumulao wabantu buyo ngubaiyide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
