              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mubuzuba obo basinkematwi bayoomvwa majwi aabbuku, ameso aaboofu ayoobona kuzwa kumudima uusia mubabede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
