                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalo babombede mumyoyo bayooyungizya lukondo lwabo lwamuli-Jehova, abantu bacete bayoosekelela muli-Uusalala waIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
