        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu Jehova iwakanununa Abrahamu mbwaamba aaluzubo lwa-Jakobo. Jakobo takooyoofwa limbi insoni, abusyu bwakwe tabukooyoousana limbi. ",
